[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11461.19, "timestamp": "03:11:01", "text": "你的大号，约翰尼。遗憾的是，我希望我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11463.67, "timestamp": "03:11:03", "text": "可以。呃，但我会等到那一天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11466.309, "timestamp": "03:11:06", "text": "我们再玩一次。你是最棒的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11468.07, "timestamp": "03:11:08", "text": "同组球员。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11471.349, "timestamp": "03:11:11", "text": "帕坎克斯。我的天啊。祝你好运！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11473.429, "timestamp": "03:11:13", "text": "旅行。也祝你生日快乐。我知道。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11476.23, "timestamp": "03:11:16", "text": "会很漂亮。之后会很漂亮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11479.75, "timestamp": "03:11:19", "text": "当你读到这篇文章时，你已经过生日了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11482.23, "timestamp": "03:11:22", "text": "实际上，那是在我生日之后。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11485.429, "timestamp": "03:11:25", "text": "上帝。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11493.75, "timestamp": "03:11:33", "text": "她还装饰并制作了铁靴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11501.99, "timestamp": "03:11:41", "text": "我的天啊。那真的很难得到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11506.87, "timestamp": "03:11:46", "text": "你知道。是的，她找到了那把剑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11510.309, "timestamp": "03:11:50", "text": "所以，呃，我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11513.349, "timestamp": "03:11:53", "text": "我记得黑色的那个是钥匙。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11516.469, "timestamp": "03:11:56", "text": "或许恰恰相反。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11518.63, "timestamp": "03:11:58", "text": "我记得她很喜欢在……玩耍"}]